    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596480/extras/0ca11415677ad2a37c07cc9a4bd181a8.avif?t=1729062174\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><i>Beastwatch is a retro-style horror shooter in which you play a security guard working his first night in a slaughterhouse.</i><br><br>Plunge into an unimaginable macabre nightmare in Beastwatch, a terrifying first-person shooter that immerses you in the heart of darkness. On your first shift as a security guard at a shadowy slaughterhouse, you expected a quiet night, but blood spills, and hidden horrors emerge as the animals take a sinister turn.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596480/extras/f4629749cbf614b14a934b9434665011.webp?t=1729062174\" width=600 height=20 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596480/extras/87d7db50676adeb1bbc7ec80ae360238.poster.avif?t=1729062174\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596480/extras/87d7db50676adeb1bbc7ec80ae360238.webm?t=1729062174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596480/extras/87d7db50676adeb1bbc7ec80ae360238.mp4?t=1729062174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Immersive Retro Atmosphere:</strong> Explore a world of terror thoughtfully designed with retro graphics that transport you to the golden age of horror gaming.<br><br></li><li> <strong>Intense First-Person Action:</strong> Confront grotesque mutations in thrilling first-person combat as you fight for survival in a slaughterhouse overrun by chaos.<br><br></li><li> <strong>Unthinkable Horrors:</strong> Face unimaginable abominations that will challenge your sanity and tactical skills around every corner.<br><br></li><li> <strong>Tense Exploration:</strong> Traverse dark hallways, chilling storerooms, and secret passages as you unravel the story behind the nightmare lurking in the slaughterhouse.<br><br></li><li> <strong>Mysteries to Uncover:</strong> Discover clues, solve puzzles, and unravel the darkest secrets of the slaughterhouse as you struggle to survive.<br><br></li><li> <strong>Claustrophobic Atmosphere:</strong> Immerse yourself in an intensely claustrophobic atmosphere where every corner hides a new terror waiting to shred you apart.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596480/extras/f4629749cbf614b14a934b9434665011.webp?t=1729062174\" width=600 height=20 /></span><br><br>Prepare for a visceral horror experience that will test your nerves and wit. <br><br>Are you ready to face your first night in the slaughterhouse?",
